              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makanda maku nĩ maleelu; matyaatonya kũlũmya nesa ĩtina ya mũlingoti woo, matyaatonya kũtambũũkya ĩla ngũa ya kwosa kĩseve: nĩvo ĩndĩ mũtavo watavĩtwe mwingĩ waaaniw’e; ala mathuaa nĩmosie mũtavo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
